<title>USA: Cracker Barrel Q4 shr falls, with charge.</title>
<headline>Cracker Barrel Q4 shr falls, with charge.</headline>
<dateline>LEBANON, Tenn. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>CRACKER BARREL OLD COUNTRY STORE, INC.</p>
<p>			  Income Statements (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			  (In 000's, except share amounts)</p>
<p>	     Fourth Quarter Ended  %     Fiscal Year Ended    %</p>
<p>		 08/02/96 07/29/95 Change 08/02/96 07/29/95 Change</p>
<p>Total sales</p>
<p>		   282,214  221,217   28    943,287  783,094   20</p>
<p> Net income     17,935   23,064  (22)    63,515   66,043  (4)</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>  share	     0.29     0.38  (24)	1.04     1.09  (5)</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>  shares	  61,120   60,599    1     60,813   60,557   --</p>
<p>NOTE - Current quarter figures include previously announced one-time charge related to write offs for closure of 3 Cracker Barrel stores, 3 Corner Markets, and the Company's point-of-sale system.  The total after-tax effect amounted to approximately $8,800 or $0.15 per share.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
